  "decision": "Support changing CPU and memory resources for running Pods without mandatory Pod or container recreation.",
  "decision_id": "Kubernetes-KEP-1287",
  "episode_id": "kep1287-20231026-pi-reported-consensus-candidate",
  "goals": [
    {
      "id": "G1",
      "keywords": [],
      "reference_status": "PI_REPORTED_HUMAN_REVIEW__DOCUMENTARY_SIGNOFF_MISSING",
      "source": "https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/5950905de89aab2be202d28b823701276cbefea0/keps/sig-node/1287-in-place-update-pod-resources/README.md#L100-L104",
      "source_section": "Summary; Goals",
      "text": "Permit CPU and memory resource requests/limits to change in place, without requiring a Pod or container restart."
    },
    {
      "id": "G2",
      "keywords": [],
      "reference_status": "PI_REPORTED_HUMAN_REVIEW__DOCUMENTARY_SIGNOFF_MISSING",
      "source": "https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/5950905de89aab2be202d28b823701276cbefea0/keps/sig-node/1287-in-place-update-pod-resources/README.md#L160-L163",
      "source_section": "Goals",
      "text": "Allow actors (e.g., users, VPA, StatefulSet, JobController) to decide how to proceed when an in-place resource resize is not possible."
    },
    {
      "decomposed_from_id": "G3",
      "id": "G3a",
      "keywords": [],
      "reference_status": "PI_REPORTED_HUMAN_REVIEW__DOCUMENTARY_SIGNOFF_MISSING",
      "source": "https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/5950905de89aab2be202d28b823701276cbefea0/keps/sig-node/1287-in-place-update-pod-resources/README.md#L166-L167",
      "source_section": "Motivation; Goals",
      "text": "Change the UpdateContainerResources CRI API to take a platform-agnostic ContainerResources parameter so that it works for Windows containers and other non-Linux runtimes, not only Linux."
    },
    {
      "decomposed_from_id": "G3",
      "id": "G3b",
      "keywords": [],
      "reference_status": "PI_REPORTED_HUMAN_REVIEW__DOCUMENTARY_SIGNOFF_MISSING",
      "source": "https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/5950905de89aab2be202d28b823701276cbefea0/keps/sig-node/1287-in-place-update-pod-resources/README.md#L168-L169",
      "source_section": "Motivation; Goals",
      "text": "Extend the ContainerStatus CRI API so the kubelet can query the CPU and memory configuration currently applied to a container."
    },
    {
      "decomposed_from_id": "G3",
      "id": "G3c",
      "keywords": [],
      "reference_status": "PI_REPORTED_HUMAN_REVIEW__DOCUMENTARY_SIGNOFF_MISSING",
      "source": "https://github.com/kubernetes/enhancements/blob/5950905de89aab2be202d28b823701276cbefea0/keps/sig-node/1287-in-place-update-pod-resources/README.md#L171-L172",
      "source_section": "Motivation; Goals",
      "text": "Define, as a high-level guide rather than a detailed implementation specification, the expected behavior of a container runtime when handling resource updates."
    }
  ],
