      "source_section": "Resize Status",
      "text": "Expose, for each resized container resource, why the desired and actual resources differ: whether a proposed resize has not yet been accepted or rejected by the kubelet, has been accepted and is being actuated, is deferred, or has been rejected as infeasible; supplemented by Pod Events at key steps."
